#. module: l10n_ca_nu_payroll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ca_nu_payroll.field_hr_contract__l10n_ca_nu_payroll_tax_exempt
msgid ""
"No Nunavut payroll tax is withheld from the pays of this contract. For an "
"employee whose remuneration is not subject: a member of a religious order "
"with a vow of perpetual poverty (Income Tax Act, s. 110(2)), or an employee "
"who normally works outside Nunavut and whose remuneration from the company "
"in the year is not expected to exceed the prescribed amount of 5,000 "
"(Payroll Tax Act, s. 3(2.2); Payroll Tax Regulations, s. 2)."
msgstr ""

